型升级已经迫在眉睫"},{"key":"C","text":"从结构转变角度看成效显著"},{"key":"D","text":"发展不平衡不充分的问题逐步缓解"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"A 文段是初步形成新模式而非探索出成熟的发展模式。B 描述问题而非成就，基调错误。C 结构转变对应了后文，当选。D 无中生有。","originalExampleFingerprint":"bdbe70a7","declaredOriginalSource":"2019深安事业编","answerSourceKeys":["[\"verbal\",\"sentence-insertion\",\"example\"]"],"semanticAdmission":{"questionBinding":{"questionId":"notes-q-app-ve02-000208","questionRevision":2,"effectiveContentDigest":"729747d91545e68445c9e56542c183b50442ca198126aabc26d8d41575e90763"},"resolvedDependencyManifest":{"primaryTargets":[{"id":"notes-target-app-ve02-000208","revision":2,"sha256":"d34792ee1ce2fc948355e3235daf3c5d8e23c6dfde60816ca88a63a0c8509e31"}],"supportingTargets":[],"knowledgeAtoms":[],"comparisonGroups":[],"sourceBindings":[{"subjectId":"verbal","pointId":"sentence-insertion","tabId":"example","revision":null,"sha256":"571cacc2c4ec608939cd48511f8432c4ada78bf2c987aba2b6d19f7b18119eab"},{"subjectId":"verbal","pointId":"sentence-insertion","tabId":"knowledge","revision":null,"sha256":"7c6910585e3e229c8df0b326d19a24ed8e1b79fd7cc7ecae36e9134c688847c5"}],"sourceAnchors":[],"originalExample":{"subjectId":"verbal","pointId":"sentence-insertion","tabId":"example","expectedBlockSha256":"bce2e864f01178901582b5c4002e53d9817eb9d1eab37b5388d010fabcdec3a9","revision":null},"materialGroup":null,"images":[],"sharedSourceBindings":[]},"dependencyDigest":"578b40007dd134e2d87b32e5950156b890cb9c4f279ac319390619b0e5fa5914","ruleVersion":"exam-goal-v4","ruleDigest":"cde4b0cf5c8f1542a5a662cc642037c39b9968aba1618b319d56fd8b62cb8033","receiptId":"app-ve02-independent-notes-q-app-ve02-000208-r2","signatureVersion":"notes-semantic-v1","signature":"a3aca3daad9b1053d11d2dbaf013e9a980d7c815e1b7fdf6becbc4f676236f80"},"knowledgeAtoms":[],"resolvedTargets":[{"id":"notes-target-app-ve02-000208","revision":2,"status":"review","subjectId":"verbal","categoryId":"sentence","statement":"中国经济结构转变","conclusion":"后文列举新产业和地区转型成效，横线应概括结构转变成效显著，选C。","conditions":["按现有笔